<title>GERMANY: Heidelberger Zement sees sales growth in 97.</title>
<headline>Heidelberger Zement sees sales growth in 97.</headline>
<dateline>HEIDELBERG, Germany 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German building materials group Heideleberger Zement AG said on Tuesday it expected positive development in international activities to boost its 1997 sales by around five percent.</p>
<p>The firm earlier reported a 7.2 percent rise in 1996 sales to 6.5 billion marks and said net profit for last year rose to 502 million marks from 469 million previously.</p>
<p>Heidelberger said that in the first quarter of 1997, sales were significantly higher.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 7565 1246</p>
</text>
